### ============================================================
### JOURNAL STATS
### ============================================================

### Default range
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 7 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats?range=7d
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 30 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats?range=30d
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 90 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats?range=90d
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ============================================================
### VALIDATION
### ============================================================

### Invalid range
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats?range=1d
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Invalid range
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats?range=365d
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Empty range
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats?range=
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================================

### Missing token
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats


### Invalid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/stats
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token
